This conda environment file can be used to create a
gfortran and netCDF env to compile pressure_decomp.  

It also can be used to compile CM1 itself.

If you have a conda environment installed for python,

"conda env create -f p_decomp.yml"

will create a new environment with the compilers and netCDF,

"conda activate p_decomp"

will activate the environment.  Then you can use the 
Makefile in the main directory
